WeeWX wFrog Skin
================

Copyright (C) 2026 Marcin Kowalik <mkowalik@agh.edu.pl>

This project is a new WeeWX-oriented implementation of the visual style,
aggregation behavior, and chart semantics of the classic wFrog project.

